WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:06.710
Have you ever woken up in the middle of the
night with an eerie feeling that someone,

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.820
or something is watching you?

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.960
Or maybe you've seen a pair of eyes in the
darkness, staring back at you and deep into

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.369
your soul.

00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:17.760
Are demons responsible for these spine-tingling
moments?

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.130
Are demons even real, and is it possible to
become possessed by one?

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:27.369
These terrifying real life stories seem to
suggest that they're more than just fables.

00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:36.670
These demonic possession stories will send
shivers down your spine.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.300
First up is the possession of German-born
Anneliese Michel.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.240
This terrifying account was so convincing
that Hollywood couldn't help but make a film

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.240
out of it.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:52.020
The 2005 film "The Exorcism of Emily Rose"
was based on the real life case of Anneliese

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.310
Michel.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:58.440
Michel had always had problems whilst growing,
she suffered from epilepsy and mental illness

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.940
for which she was treated at a psychiatric
hospital.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:08.040
However it was not until 1973 when Michel
was 20 years old, when things really started

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.680
to get weird.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:16.220
Michel became suicidal, she started to vehemently
reject all religious objects and symbols,

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.720
she drank her own urine and started hearing
voices which told her to "rot in hell".

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:25.070
She also started seeing the faces of devils.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:30.390
Catholic Bishop Josef Stangl used his upmost
authority as a member of the Catholic church

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:34.870
to deduce that this behave wasn't normal for
a 20 year old girl.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:38.020
And she was likely possessed by a demon.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:42.310
Stangl performed an exorcism ritual in total
secrecy.

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:47.659
Over the next 10 months Michel had a staggering
70 exorcisms performed on her.

00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:52.860
Meanwhile her parents stopped treating her
epilepsy and mental disorders.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:58.170
After a year of this she died and dehydration
and malnutrition.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:03.110
The priests who conducted the exorcisms were
found guilty of manslaughter and sentenced

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.119
to six months behind bars.

00:02:05.119 --> 00:02:10.759
I think there's an important lesson here,
if the first 20 exorcisms don't work out,

00:02:10.759 --> 00:02:14.379
the next 50 probably aren't going to either.

00:02:14.379 --> 00:02:18.999
Next up is the unnerving story of Michael
Taylor who lived with his wife Christine in

00:02:18.999 --> 00:02:22.279
a small town called Ossett in Great Britain.

00:02:22.279 --> 00:02:26.530
The couple were very religious and regularly
attended a Christian prayer group.

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:32.849
At one peculiar meeting in 1974 Michael's
wife Christine Taylor accused her husband

00:02:32.849 --> 00:02:36.140
of having an affair with the leader of the
prayer group.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:42.060
Taylor obviously wasn't too pleased with the
accusation because he began to spew obscenities

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:48.260
at his wife and started to act extremely erratic,
which was very much out of character.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:54.099
Witnessed concluded that he had been possessed
by some kind of evil spirit.

00:02:54.099 --> 00:02:58.769
This insane behaviour continued for months
until Taylor eventually consulted a priest

00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:05.420
who performed an exorcism on him which lasted
for a gruelling 24 hours.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:11.079
According to the priests involved in the exorcism,
they removed forty demons from Taylor's body.

00:03:11.079 --> 00:03:17.269
However the priests warned him that the demons
may still remain dormant in his soul.

00:03:17.269 --> 00:03:22.370
And he wasn't far wrong, because Taylor then
went home and brutally murdered his wife and

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:28.519
their dog, after which he wandered the streets
for hours, covered in blood, before being

00:03:28.519 --> 00:03:30.269
arrested.

00:03:30.269 --> 00:03:36.319
Next up is the real life account that the
infamous 1974 film "The Exorcist" is based

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:37.319
on.

00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:42.610
But there's a twist, the actual possession
happened to a male, not a female, like in

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.699
the film.

00:03:43.699 --> 00:03:48.209
The actual possession happened to fourteen
year-old Roland Doe, which is actually not

00:03:48.209 --> 00:03:49.499
his real name.

00:03:49.499 --> 00:03:54.540
The Catholic church assigned this pseudonym
to him to protect the boy's privacy.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:04:00.439
The bone-chilling real-life story goes like
this: It was the late 1940s in Cottage City,

00:04:00.439 --> 00:04:05.659
Maryland, and Roland Doe attempted to contact
his late aunt, through a Ouija board.

00:04:05.659 --> 00:04:10.150
Many believe this is what opened the door
to a flurry of demons who wished to possess

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.150
him.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:15.439
Unfortunately the countless horror films where
little Jimmy find a Oujia board in the attic

00:04:15.439 --> 00:04:20.940
and accidentally brings through a thousand
evil demons hadn't yet been made, so poor

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.490
Roland Doe was none the wiser.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:27.729
His family started to hear strange sounds
around the house like scratching, dripping

00:04:27.729 --> 00:04:31.430
water and unexplained footsteps.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.290
Then religious artefacts started flying from
the walls.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:39.240
Then Doe levitated into the air, his body
unnaturally contorted, speaking in tongues

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.789
in a guttural voice.

00:04:40.789 --> 00:04:44.930
It was about then that the boy's family decided
it was about time to do something about this

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.590
unnatural behaviour.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.270
They brought in a priest to perform an exorcism.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:54.810
The ritual was performed over 30 times before
the priest deemed it successful.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.840
Doe injured the priest multiple times during
the exorcisms.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:04.689
Those present reported a horrible sulphuric
odour lingering in the air afterwards.

00:05:04.689 --> 00:05:07.530
Afterwards Doe returned to his normal life.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:12.770
Next up is George Lukins a man from England
in the late 17th century.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:18.180
Lukins was a greedy bugger because he claimed
to be possessed by not one, but seven demons,

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:22.479
and he requested seven different priests to
remove the demons from his body.

00:05:22.479 --> 00:05:27.780
It all started when Sarah Barber, a close
fried of Lukins noticed that he had started

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.939
to act rather strangely.

00:05:29.939 --> 00:05:37.009
According to Barber, Lukins had slowly deteriorated
mentally and physically over the past 18 years.

00:05:37.009 --> 00:05:40.730
He started to have seizures and growl at people
around him.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.760
He talked in disturbing, supernatural tones.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:50.900
In 1778 seven priests performed a lengthy
exorcism on Lukins at the Temple Church in

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.100
Bristol, England.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:57.460
As soon as the exorcism commenced with one
of the priests singing a hymn, Lukins turned

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:02.349
extremely violent and started barking and
hissing at the priests.

00:06:02.349 --> 00:06:08.150
Lukins then cycled through seven different
demonic personalities over the span of the

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:14.509
exorcism, before finally declaring out loud
that he was the "devil himself".

00:06:14.509 --> 00:06:19.860
Afterwards, according to the priests who were
present, the exorcism was a success, the demons

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:24.639
were sent back to hell, and George Lukins
returned to a normal life.

00:06:24.639 --> 00:06:31.090
Next up is an infamous serial killer who was
supposedly spurred on to kill by a demon.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:36.110
He was known as the Son of Sam, although his
real name was David Berkowitz.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:42.560
Berkowitz began murdering in 1976 and continued
his ruthless killing campaign for an entire

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.890
year before he was caught.

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:47.780
His killings all had a very similar MO.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:53.020
He would approach a stranger in the dead of
night and shoot them with a .44 revolver,

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.949
then he would leave immediately without uttering
a word.

00:06:56.949 --> 00:07:02.539
However at one of the crime scenes the police
found a stomach turning note left by Berkowitz.

00:07:02.539 --> 00:07:07.969
The note talked about his father called "Sam"
who drank blood and kept Berkowitz locked

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:09.310
in an attic.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:14.650
The note also said that "Father Sam" commands
Berkowitz to "go out and kill".

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:23.689
But this is the strange part, Berkowitz didn't
have a father named Sam, his father was actually

00:07:23.689 --> 00:07:28.569
called Tony, so who on Earth, or hell was
Sam?

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:34.099
Well get this, according to Berkowitz, Sam
was the name of the demon who possessed his

00:07:34.099 --> 00:07:35.409
neighbour's dog.

00:07:35.409 --> 00:07:36.720
Yes, dog.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:41.659
When Berkowitz a.k.a the "Son of Sam", as
he had come to be known, was finally arrested

00:07:41.659 --> 00:07:48.490
in 1977 after killing 6 known victims, he
confessed to the murders.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:53.650
He explained how his neighbours dog was a
conduit for an evil demon and the dog had

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.620
commanded him to carry out every murder.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:01.699
Remember guys, if you don't have an alibi,
you can always blame it on the dog!

00:08:01.699 --> 00:08:05.930
Actually no, wait, that doesn't work at all,
David Berkowitz got six life sentences for

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.099
his evil demon-dog fuelled murders.

00:08:09.099 --> 00:08:11.240
Next we go to Natal, South Africa.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:18.530
Where, in 1906 a Christian student named Clara
Germana Cele started to act very strangely.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:24.310
Up until the age of sixteen Clara had always
been a very ordinary girl, but that all changed

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:30.980
pretty quickly, when Clara started displaying
some rather incredible, yet creepy, superhuman

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.150
powers.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:38.890
Clara started to speak and understand German,
French, and Polish, fluently, despite the

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:44.100
fact that she had never studied or even heard
this languages before.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:48.870
Clara was also able to reveal the most intimate
secrets about people whom she had never met

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:49.970
before.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:56.410
Clara started to mysteriously levitate vertically
out of her bed and she had superhuman levels

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:01.310
of strength, able to throw people twice her
size across the room.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:07.100
It is said by witnesses that her voice sounded
like "a veritable herd of wild beasts orchestrated

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.920
by Satan".

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:13.990
Clara later revealed that she had made a pact
with Satan, giving him the ability to take

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.340
over her body.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.450
Had she really made a pact with Satan?

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.780
Well, the local priests certainly thought
so.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:27.790
Two priests performed an exorcism on Clara
that lasted two days, during which, over 170

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:34.450
people witnessed her levitating several feet
in the air, whilst the priests read Scriptures.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:38.890
After the exorcism it was the general consensus
of the priests and those present, that the

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.940
evil spirits had been expunged from her body.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:46.430
Presumably Satan was displeased that Clara
hadn't kept her end of the bargain.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:52.940
In 2008, a board-certified psychiatrist at
New York Medical College, named Dr. Richard

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.240
Gallagher was given a very unique opportunity.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.680
A bishop asked him to provide psychiatric
analysis of a woman who claimed to be possessed

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.860
by demons.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:07.350
Usually scientists and doctors just pass off
these cases as mental illness, but Gallagher

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:12.410
put his prejudices aside and agreed to examine
her.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:16.730
During the examination, the woman, who was
given the pseudonym of "Julia" to protect

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.980
her identity starting out completely normal.

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:25.530
But then demon's obviously reminded her of
the small fact that she was possessed because

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:30.470
she suddenly went into a trance like state
followed by a fit of rage.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:35.120
She started to shout at Gallagher and others
in the room, telling them to "Go away you

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:36.120
idiots!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.150
Leave her alone".

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:42.900
Julia started to shake violently, then objects
flew from the shelves.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:47.150
After Gallagher examined Julia a decision
was reached between the bishop and himself

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:49.680
that Julia should be exorcised.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:55.220
During the exorcism Julia screamed obscenities
at the priests in Latin and Spanish.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:11:02.140
She reportedly levitated 15 centimetres off
the ground for half and hour and she screamed

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.370
in pain when she was sprinkled with holy water.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:10.510
And finally is the infamous murder trial of
Arne Cheyenne Johnson in 1981.

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:16.070
This was the first ever case in the US where
a lawyer pleaded their client's innocence

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.710
on the grounds of demonic possession.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.260
In other words, "he didn't do it, it was the
demon".

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:27.370
But how did Johnson find himself in court,
well about a year earlier Johnson stabbed

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:32.450
his landlord, Alan Bono, to death with a pocketknife,
in Connecticut.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:36.840
Before the stabbing, family members close
to Johnson began having demonic visions and

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:43.030
heard noises in the house, such as footsteps,
doors slamming, and mysterious voices.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:48.030
Johnson's fiancé's younger brother, David,
reported seeing an apparition that looked

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:54.800
like “a man with big black eyes, a thin
face with animal features and jagged teeth,

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.560
pointed ears, horns, and hoofs.”.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:03.810
Shortly afterwards David started having convulsions
and bruises appeared on his body.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.350
He started to shout at the family in Latin.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:11.710
A few days later Johnson himself said he had
also become possessed.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:18.200
It eventually came to a climax a few weeks
later, when the family held a party in their

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.200
home.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.930
According to everyone who attended the party,
Johnson went into a trance, walked slowly

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:30.160
towards his landlord, growling under his breath,
then all of a sudden stabbed him multiple

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.820
times in the chest.

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:37.760
A year later and the judge at Johnson's murder
trial ruled that demonic possession was not

00:12:37.760 --> 00:13:02.440
a valid defence against murder and Johnson
was given a twenty year prison sentence.

